{"id":"249ce19d50d1f381","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-baire-category.md","title":"Baire 范畴定理","display":"thm-baire-category — Baire 范畴定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-baire-category","aliases":["20-thm-baire-category"],"display":"thm-baire-category — Baire 范畴定理","chapter":"14","section":"14.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 14.1.2","source_pdf_pages":[241],"source_printed_pages":[212],"depends_on":["[[20-df-category]]","[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-baire-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-baire-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-baire-category — Baire 范畴定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"14"},{"key":"section","html":"14.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 14.1.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>241</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>212</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3e4bc829c39df8c\" href=\"?note=e3e4bc829c39df8c\" title=\"20-df-category\">20-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comeager}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Comeager}(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e3e4bc829c39df8c\" href=\"?note=e3e4bc829c39df8c\" title=\"20-df-category\">20-df-category</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}baire\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [A\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}baire\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [A\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取稠密开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcap_nU_n\\subseteq A\">\\(\\bigcap_nU_n\\subseteq A\\)</span>。给初始柱 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\sigma]\">\\([\\sigma]\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_0=\\sigma\">\\(\\tau_0=\\sigma\\)</span>。稠密性在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\tau_n]\">\\([\\tau_n]\\)</span> 内给一点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_n\\in U_n\">\\(X_n\\in U_n\\)</span>，开性再给更长的前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{n+1}\\succeq X_n\\upharpoonright|\\tau_n|\">\\(\\tau_{n+1}\\succeq X_n\\upharpoonright|\\tau_n|\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_n\\prec\\tau_{n+1}\">\\(\\tau_n\\prec\\tau_{n+1}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\tau_{n+1}]\\subseteq U_n\">\\([\\tau_{n+1}]\\subseteq U_n\\)</span>。更直接地，可在非空候选串集中按固定代码次序选最小串，无需假设该选择有效。</p>\n<p>严格增长使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\bigcup_n\\tau_n\">\\(X=\\bigcup_n\\tau_n\\)</span> 成为唯一无限序列。它在初始柱中，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span>，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。这是集合论存在性证明；没有从一般稠密开集的数据推得可计算选择。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 14.1.2；印刷 212 / PDF 241。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"e3e4bc829c39df8c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"e3e4bc829c39df8c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-category]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comeager}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}baire\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\ [A\\cap[\\sigma]\\ne\\varnothing].","display":true},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcap_nU_n\\subseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_0=\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"[\\tau_n]","display":false},{"tex":"X_n\\in U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{n+1}\\succeq X_n\\upharpoonright|\\tau_n|","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_n\\prec\\tau_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"[\\tau_{n+1}]\\subseteq U_n","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\bigcup_n\\tau_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1431,"backlinks":[{"id":"088f0b71a9b22ef9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_